{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Calling from the east an eagle.</b> This is Cyrus, and he called him an eagle, as though he flies to fulfill My will." "<b>Aye, I have spoken.</b> This decree — \"aye, I will bring it\" — I formed it in the decree of heaven; \"aye, I will do it\" on earth."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:19.103680303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}